.TH EASEFN 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
EaseFn \- An easing curve: maps progress t in 0..1 to an eased 0..1
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqtween.h\(dq
.ft B
typedef float (*EaseFn)(float);
.ft R
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
An easing curve: maps progress t in 0..1 to an eased 0..1. Pass one of the ease_* functions to tween_start(); write your own with the same signature for custom motion.
.SH MODULE
tween (src/engine/tween/tween.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ease_linear (3),
.BR ease_out_quad (3),
.BR tween_start (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
